# Optional fallback only. The recommended way to configure Unconscious is
# through the Settings panel in the running web UI, which stores keys in
# unconscious.db and lets you change or clear them without a restart.
#
# If ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set here, it's used whenever no key has been
# saved via the UI. Copy this file to .env if you want that fallback;
# .env itself is not read automatically unless you export these into your
# shell (e.g. `set -a; source .env; set +a`) before running uvicorn.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
